<title>USA: Sirrom to top Q1 earnings estimates.</title>
<headline>Sirrom to top Q1 earnings estimates.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sirrom Capital Corp said on Friday it expects first quarter earnings per share to exceed analysts' estimates of $0.40 a share.</p>
<p>That estimate came from I/B/E/S International Inc's surveys of securities analysts that follow the company.</p>
<p>SCC intends to announce its results for the first quarter, which ended March 31, on Wednesday, April 9, 1997.</p>
<p>Sirrom Capital, a specialty finance company, reported 1996 first quarter net operating earnings of $454,000, or $0.05 a share.</p>
